TheMagnumChad/PokeZ-ARecomp-Online PR #5 by JeffeSouza (b0bac92, open): Change Moves - ZL / ZR keys switch its tabs and its tab icons show on keyboard; a held direction releases the wheel-scroll selection guard. (Its tools/za/prompt_textures.py part only affects the zaprompts helper, which this AppImage doesn't ship.)

diff --git a/runtime/hle/bindings.c b/runtime/hle/bindings.c
